# IV. LAN MULTI-DEVICE SUPPORT (PLACEHOLDER ONLY)
SIC must support joining an active debate session from another device on the same LAN.

Cursor must scaffold:
- A LAN scan for a **session descriptor** on a known port.
- If found → show “Join Existing Debate Session”.
- If not found → hide the option.

Cursor must not implement:
- Real networking logic.
- Complex discovery protocols.

This is placeholder scaffolding only.

